<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\警察署受付.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> and I went back to the police station and went on waiting for hours, in case any news of <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> came in.<PG>
After that, the police searched the area, but neither <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> nor <STYLE ID="3">Auntie</STYLE> was found.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
According to <STYLE ID="4">Ise-san</STYLE>, there was no trace of anyone entering a floor on the way down.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At the spot that looked like the landing point, fresh footprints that looked to have been made with great force.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The car owned by the Niimura family was missing too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In other words, it seemed they really had jumped from the fifth floor and fled by car.<PG>
At first, though, jumping from the fifth floor was unthinkable, so the search was concentrated on the area around the apartment building.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So the cordon over the whole of Motoki-cho went up late, and where that car had gone was unknown.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
About that part, <STYLE ID="4">Ise-san</STYLE> was full of regret, saying he had made an error of judgment.<PG>
All the same, no one jumps off the roof of a five-story apartment building and comes away unhurt.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was then that I remembered the spiriting-away theory about the Megasawa City murders.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, I am sure </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is safe."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Yeah... </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> would never lay a hand on </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\警察署時計.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Before long, April 8 was coming to an end.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The anniversary of <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>'s dad's death... and from today it becomes the anniversary of <STYLE ID="6">my own dad</STYLE>'s death as well.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
I closed my eyes and put my hands together.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At least I could pray like this for peace for the two of them...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This was the only thing I could do before April 8 ended.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\警察署受付.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "100" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島合掌.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "500" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
When I opened my eyes, <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> had her eyes closed and her hands together as well.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\シナリオ\000過去へ馳せる夢\時計11回.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "5000" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
The time signal announcing midnight―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This sound is the same as the clock in <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>'s house...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I will never hear this sound in <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>'s house again.<PG>
No, <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> is definitely coming back.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> will definitely come back to me.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... that letter...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"A letter?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　What do you mean?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"I don't know anything. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, you don't know anything either... do you...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "ネジの壊れたロボット.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "900" "0"}
Only I, <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE> know about that letter.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It might just be a clue to finding <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>.<PG>
But if I hand it to the police, it seems <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> and I will both be destroyed socially, and that is not what I am afraid of.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I make it public, I will lose even more of the people who matter to me. That was the feeling I had.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
And then one of those people who matter, <STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE>, appeared.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">... </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE>'s face was even more gaunt than before.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She had been held by the police for hours, and on top of that her best friend <STYLE ID="3">Auntie</STYLE> had disappeared.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE>'s mental state had to be close to its limit as well.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, are you all right? Just now I was talking with </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> about letters."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"That letter of </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s from the other day was a lot of fun! But do keep the letters from me somewhere people cannot find them!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> said this and grinned from ear to ear.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> and I had never exchanged letters. This was a blatant lie on <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>'s part.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE> heard it, and her expression did not change.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"I'm just... going out for some air..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE> walked out of the police station with heavy steps.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I turned my eyes to <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>, the smile of a moment ago was gone.<PG>
I know why <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> said a thing like that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE> must have read that letter too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Which means <STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE> must know what lies behind this incident.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE> knew something was going to happen, and she did not even try to stop it―<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>'s lie just now is her strongest possible protest against <STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE>, and her anger.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And even so, <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> showed me every possible consideration.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I will forget about that letter as well. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But if </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> looked, she would find that letter at once where it was put away. You understand what putting it there was meant to do... don't you...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At last I understood.<PG>
I had not really understood how <STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE> came to be at the police station in the first place, but so that was it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If anything happened, <STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE> had meant to make that letter public.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE> has already steeled herself for something.<PG>
But for my sake and <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>'s, she has not made it public yet.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I still do not know the reason, but if she is acting in a contradictory way like this, <STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE> must still be in real agony even now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> said something to <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="さかな">rub</STYLE> that the wrong way means her anger at <STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE> must be considerable.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島横顔.gal" "WAIT" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... I'm sorry... Saying such a cruel thing to </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But... I will apologize, but I will not repent."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>, like <STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE>, is in agony.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Her anger at <STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE> and her feelings for me must be colliding violently inside <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>.
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "189" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">... what's going to happen to her..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"At best, turning herself in. At worst―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"All right. You don't have to say it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What is all this...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What do you mean, turning herself in! What do you mean, at worst!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE>, did you do something!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Dad</STYLE>, did you do something you had to be killed for!?<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>, <STYLE ID="6">Dad</STYLE>, <STYLE ID="7">Mom</STYLE>, all of them are disappearing from in front of me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why is it always the people who matter to me...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe I myself will be next, before long―<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">... am I going to disappear too..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"It's all right. I will be beside you no matter what...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Really...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"What I am now, I owe to my </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. So... if even </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> were gone... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">what would become of me... My mind would probably break..."</STYLE><PG>
Inside <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> there seemed to be an instinct for self-preservation with something childish still left in it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That is probably part of the reason <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> is not making that letter public.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Yeah, it's all right, I'll be right beside you too, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">. </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, you're not alone either."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Thank you. I really cannot do without </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">―"</STYLE><PG>
{CHGVOL "BGM" "700" "3000" "PASS"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\アスファルトダッシュ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "3000" "WAIT"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "1000" "WAIT"}
{MESON "500"}
A woman came into the police station.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Someone I had never seen before...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\桃子.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Erina</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\椅子から立つ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So this was <STYLE ID="9">Goto's older sister</STYLE>...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had heard about her, but this was the first time I had met her.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But she had said that she and <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> did not get along...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\桃子五島抱きしめる.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Siiis</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">! </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> clung to her <STYLE ID="9">older sister</STYLE> and began to cry like a kindergartener.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Honestly... you never stop being a brat, however much time passes..."</STYLE><PG>
I see... so it was not that they really got along badly; they had just been passing each other by a little...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At the same time as I felt relieved, I felt just a tiny bit lonely.<PG>
{MESOFF "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">... I'll be waiting..."</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "エンド画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\lcm\ルートエンド.lcm" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "000" "CLICK"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
